## r1-theme-roles-scope

This section documents the **R1 Theme Roles** scope: TextRole/Space/Height enums and their resolution methods in src/theme.rs.

### State Extraction (STEP 2)

**Enums present in src/theme.rs:**
- `enum TextRole` (line 688) — Title, Heading, Body, Caption, Micro, Code
- `enum Space` (line 677) — Small, Normal, Large
- `enum Height` (line 705) — Control, Row

**Metrics struct (line 298)** — Holds sizing constants:
```rust
pub struct Metrics {
    gap_small: f32,          // small spacing
    gap: f32,                // normal spacing
    gap_large: f32,          // large spacing
    control_height: f32,     // control height
    row_height: f32,         // row height
    ...
}
```

**Resolution methods:**
- `Theme::spacing(Space) -> f32` (line 646) — Resolves Space enum to f32
- `Theme::text_size(TextRole) -> f32` (line 655) — Resolves TextRole enum to f32 (hardcoded)
- `Theme::control_height(Height) -> f32` (line 667) — Resolves Height enum to f32

